        "name": "preamp_stage",
        "description": "NE5532 dual low-noise op-amp configured as low-level preamplifier. Channel 1 (OUT1, IN1_P, IN1_N) used for audio gain stage. Single-supply operation: VCC_P (Pin 8) connects to VIN_9V, VCC_N (Pin 4) connects to GND. Input biasing at VCC/2 required via external passive network for single-supply operation. Gain set via external feedback network to contribute to total system gain of 100x-200x. Output AC-coupled to power amplifier input. Ground return path should star-connect to system ground point to minimize noise.",
