        "description": "LM386 low-voltage audio power amplifier. VS (Pin 6) connects to VIN_9V, GND (Pin 4) connects to GND. Gain configured via GAIN_1 (Pin 1) and GAIN_2 (Pin 8) using external passive network to achieve target system gain. BYPASS (Pin 7) requires external capacitor to GND for stability. IN_POS (Pin 3) receives preamp signal. IN_NEG (Pin 2) referenced to ground. VOUT (Pin 5) drives 8-ohm speaker load via output coupling capacitor. Ground return path should star-connect to system ground point.",
